# kw-options-full: Does an options line that names a missing file load (XPPAUT 8.2.2)?
# xpp: 5
# pc: ODE0034
# ruling: XPPAUT prints Loading new options file and goes on. The file is read after the defaults are set, so it changes nothing in a headless run.
x'=0
x(0)=3
par a=5
aux v=a
options none.opt
@ total=0,dt=1
